                  },
                  "text": "Hi there,<br><br>You don’t need another list of generic creator tips. Growthline starts with your own account.<br><br>Go to your <strong><u>Profile</u></strong> and connect your video account. We’ll turn your data into a personal growth report: what’s working, where you stand and what to make next.",
